{
  "case_id": "QUIVER-LIVING-PAGE-1.20.1",
  "title": "魔法箭袋 × 活体书页（forge-1.20.1 对等验证）：箭袋对书页命中是否生效（需佩戴 + 已武装 + 目标命中前已有标记 + 不在 1 分钟冷却），触发时额外 +1 层标记并返还第一张使用的效果牌",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": { "type": "feature", "ref": "magic-quiver-on-living-page" },
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    { "op": "note", "text": "目的（2026-09-19 用户要求「功能验证：验证『魔法箭袋』对活体书页是否生效，以及作用路径和实现方式」）：把「箭袋是否对书页生效」拆成**四条可判定语义**，用现有探针在游戏内取证。\n  ① **路径接通**：书页命中伤害登记为 `astral_dice:card_spell`（法伤白名单 `SpellDamageRegistry#isSpellDamage` 的第 4 条 matcher）⇒ `DamageEffectCardHandler#onLivingDamagePre` 会遍历法伤修饰器，其中注册着魔法箭袋修饰器（`isActive` = 佩戴 + 已武装 + 冷却已结束 + **目标当前已有标记**；`onHit` → `MagicQuiverChipItem#tryProc`）；\n  ② **武装来源**：`BaseEffectCardItem` 出牌成功后的复制计数钩子会调 `MagicQuiverChipItem#onEffectCardUsed(player, cardTypeId())` —— 书页走「手持即选择 → 确认 → playFromSelector → tryUseCard」，故确认时同样会武装（记录 `first=living_page`）；\n  ③ **触发效果**：额外施加 1 层标记 + 返还记录的那张效果牌（`VitaminPillChipItem#giveCard`）+ 进入 1 分钟冷却（1200 tick）+ 清除武装；\n  ④ **不触发的三种情形**：未佩戴箭袋、目标在**命中那一刻**没有标记（首次打干净目标：书页自己那一层是在 `hurt` 返回**之后**才施加的，且修饰器的 `isActive` 在全部 `onHit` **之前**统一求值 ⇒ 同一次命中里新加的层数不参与判定）、以及 1 分钟冷却未结束。\n\n做法：探针新增 `/astralprobe quiver <tag>`（只读：`equipped/tracking/cd/first/mark/cards`）并给 `lpReadout` 追加 `cards=`（主背包内**活体书页**张数 —— 出牌会吃掉手牌、触发返还时会回 1 张，故它是「返还确实到手」的直接读数）。四组场景：\n  · A 无箭袋 + 靶预置 1 层 ⇒ 期望 `mark=2`（只有书页那一层）、`cards=0`；\n  · B 装箭袋 + 靶预置 0 层 ⇒ 期望 `mark=1`、`cards=0`，但 `quiver` 读到 `tracking=1:first=living_page`（**已武装却未触发** ⇒ 说明挡它的是「目标没有标记」这一条，而不是路径不通）；\n  · C 在同一次武装窗口内打**预置 1 层**的靶 ⇒ 期望 `mark=3`（箭袋 +1、书页 +1）、`cards=1`（返还到手）、`credit=0`（书页的连续出牌判定基准是命中**前**层数=1，本发不补记）、`quiver` 读到 `tracking=0:cd>0`（已触发并进入冷却）；\n  · D 冷却内（60 秒未过）再打预置 1 层的靶 ⇒ 期望 `mark=2`、`cards=0`、`tracking=0`（武装被冷却挡住）。\n  靶统一用 `minecraft:spider`（16 血、非亡灵不烧；与 LIVING-PAGE 用例同口径），每组先 `lprin <tag> 0` 把「调查员已用页数」归零，使 `dmg` 恒为 2、只让标记层数/卡牌数承担判据。\n\n已知边界（如实登记）：箭袋的触发在伤害事件内一次性完成，`mark` 单看无法区分「箭袋 +1」与「书页 +1」，故每条判据都用 **`mark` × `cards` × `tracking`/`cd`** 三者交叉钉死；本用例只覆盖「书页命中触发法伤链」这一条路径，不覆盖箭袋对其它法伤（激光/板砖等）与其它触发器。" },
    { "op": "note", "text": "基线前置：先清空筹码栏（`equipslot chip air`）。本用例**不 purge 存档**（复用同一个测试世界），上一轮可能在筹码栏里留下已佩戴的箭袋；清空后由产物侧 `onChipUnequip` 连武装位一起清掉 ⇒ `equipped=0:tracking=0` 与存档历史无关。`first`（上一轮记录的首张牌，武装时改写、卸载不清）、靶位 `mark` 与背包内存量会随存档延续，故基线里这三处按「任意值」判定 —— 判定力落在 A–D 四组的**差值**上。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe equipslot chip \"minecraft:air\" Q0X", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe quiver Q0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/gamemode survival", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/gamerule naturalRegeneration false", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/time set midnight", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/kill @e[type=!player,distance=..64]", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "A 组（对照）：未佩戴箭袋 + 靶预置 1 层标记 ⇒ 箭袋不可能触发，书页命中只加自己那 1 层（mark 1→2）、且不返还卡牌（cards=0）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpprep QA \"minecraft:spider\" 4 1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lprin QA0 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 500 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpshoot QA", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1600 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpread QA", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 600 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "B 组：装上魔法箭袋筹码 + 靶预置 **0** 层 ⇒ 书页命中时目标没有标记 ⇒ 箭袋**不触发**（mark=1、cards=0），但 `quiver` 应读到「已武装」（tracking=1、first=living_page）⇒ 证明路径通、挡它的是标记条件。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe equipslot chip \"astral_dice:magic_quiver_chip\" QB0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe quiver QB1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 600 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpprep QB \"minecraft:spider\" 4 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lprin QB0 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 500 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpshoot QB", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1600 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpread QB", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 500 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe quiver QB2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 600 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "C 组（正例）：仍在同一次武装窗口内（B 组未触发故冷却未开始、武装保留）+ 靶预置 1 层 ⇒ 书页命中时目标已有标记 ⇒ 箭袋**触发**：额外 +1 层（mark 1→3）、返还第一张使用的效果牌（cards=1）、进入 1 分钟冷却并清除武装（tracking=0、cd>0）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpprep QC \"minecraft:spider\" 4 1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lprin QC0 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 500 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpshoot QC", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1600 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpread QC", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 500 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe quiver QC2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 600 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "D 组（冷却闸门）：C 组刚触发过，60 秒冷却未结束 ⇒ 出牌时无法武装，命中时也没有标记来源 ⇒ 箭袋**不触发**（mark=2、cards=0、tracking=0、cd 仍 >0）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpprep QD \"minecraft:spider\" 4 1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lprin QD0 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 500 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpshoot QD", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1600 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpread QD", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 500 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe quiver QD2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 600 },

    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe equipslot chip \"minecraft:air\" QZ", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 800 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe lpclean QZ9", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 }
  ],
  "asserts": [
